The file opens with `// Issue #1392 research repro (bench round-2 forensics)`, but this PR and the artifact's home card are #1395 ("Alive-but-silent provider streams … reframes #1392's prime suspect"), whose Architecture item 1 and AC1 are exactly this suite. The #1392 references are correct historical context, but a future reader landing on this file from the GOAL card has no thread tying them together. Suggest a one-line touch-up:

